OL,3,GNEWSATown to get 51 more electric buses
OL,4,Aby 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FFifty-one new electric buses are
OL,7,Fplanned for a town as part of a
OL,8,Fmulti-million pound investment in
OL,9,Fpublic transport.
OL,11,FThe vehicles in Northampton are
OL,12,Fexpected to enter service in spring
OL,13,F2027 and will bring the town's planned
OL,14,Felectric bus fleet to 105.
OL,16,FOf the new buses in Northampton, 27
OL,17,Fwill be paid for with #4.4m in combined
OL,18,Ffunding from West and North
OL,19,FNorthamptonshire councils.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
