OL,3,GNEWSATown to get 51 more electric buses
OL,4,Aby 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,F"This investment is great news for West
OL,7,FNorthamptonshire," said Simon
OL,8,FLightwood, government minister for
OL,9,Fbuses and local transport.
